摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Skin center plugin and built-in skins for the DSH Web GUI: skins are pure asset directories, loaded and rendered by the skin center, and installed on demand from dsh-market.com.","id":"gh:1383622941","install_available":true,"language":"CSS","name":"dsh-skins","slug":"zhu1090093659/dsh-skins","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","dsh-web","skins","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Skin center plugin and built-in skins for the DSH Web GUI: skins are pure asset directories, loaded "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"and rendered by the skin center, and installed on demand from dsh-market.com."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-skins · Skin Center for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Theme & Personalization Engine for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web GUI & Desktop Client"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Themes & Skins · Frosted Glass Blur · Custom Themes · Live Try-On · Wallpaper Engine via its dedicat"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"Skins · Frosted Glass Blur · Custom Themes · Live Try-On · Wallpaper Engine via its dedicated plugin"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`@linxin666/dsh-client-ui-skin-center` (cordis plugin id `ui-skin-center`) is the single skin packag"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"e of the dsh Web GUI: it puts the skin list / try-on / apply into the real GUI as the Skins TAB unde"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"r Settings → Web Extensions (or a standalone first-level Skin Center section without that parent), l"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"isting only installed skins, and it is the only loader and renderer for skins. A skin is a pure asse"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"t directory — no package.json, no npm publish, no cordis wiring — that couples only to the skin-cent"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"er contract (`contracts/`); the skin center absorbs every official-DSH coupling behind that contract"},{"id":"p6s7","text":". The card carries its own enable switch (off disables try-on, apply and the background controls)."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- List: shows \"官方默认\" (official default) plus every installed skin in the catalog with its name, tagl"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ine and accent color; the currently active target carries the Active marker. The catalog merges two "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"sources: the default skin shipped inside this package (`skins/blue-fantasy/`) and user skins dropped"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" into `$DSH_HOME/skins/<id>/` (a user skin with the same id shadows the built-in one). Every other s"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"kin of the collection is a market item: install it on demand from the DSH Market store (one-click in"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"stall) into `$DSH_HOME/skins/<id>/`, where this same catalog manages it as a user skin — no restart,"},{"id":"p7s7","text":" reopen the card or reload to pick it up. Skins whose `skin.json` fails validation are excluded fail"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"-closed and reported as catalog diagnostics.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Core Capabilities & Scenarios"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| User Goal & Scenario | Stock DSH Web Limitation | Skin Center (dsh-skins) Solution |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Personalized aesthetics and eye-care dark theme | Default single monochrome theme only | Bundled B"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"lue Fantasy dark theme + one-click install for dozens of curated themes from Workshop |\n| Interactiv"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"e dynamic wallpaper via Wallpaper Engine | No dynamic video or animated wallpaper support | Delegate"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"d to the dedicated dsh-wallpaper-engine plugin (video, web, and 2D/3D WebGL real-time scenes), which"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" this card installs from and hands the backdrop to |\n| Frosted glass blur & composer scrim controls "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"| Flat background with no visual depth or layering | Background scrim (0–100%), adaptive conversatio"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"n blur, follower frosted composer glass & bubble opacity |\n| Custom brand palette & CSS token remapp"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"ing | Unable to tweak accent colors or contrast | Independent light/dark accent, background, foregro"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"und and contrast tuning with audited CSS token coverage |\n| Live theme try-on and zero-flash hot swi"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"tching | Theme changes require server restarts or reloads | Atomic hot-switch engine for live previe"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"w, clean rollback, and instant boot without white FOUC flashes |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Most popular skins"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The three most-liked skins in the Workshop's skin category on dsh-market.com, in the site's default "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ked skins in the Workshop's skin category on dsh-market.com, in the site's default popularity order:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Skin | Author | Look |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Abyssal Maid Atelier (`maid-atelier`) | Small-tailqwq | Twin-maid atelier backdrop, deep-sea blue "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"lace surfaces and a chibi sidebar |\n| Whale Girl · The Unreached (`whale-fantasy`) | stushansusu | C"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"yber data-rain close-up backdrop, cold-navy holographic HUD and electric-cyan accents |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- All `/api/skin-center/*` routes are same-origin only: writes reject cross-site requests (Sec-Fetch"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"-Site / Origin fence), and asset reads are contained inside each skin directory (path escapes fail c"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"losed).\n- Skin CSS is sanitized (whitelist) before serving; `patches.css` (L3) is arbitrary CSS by d"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"esign and disclosed as such — it runs with full page styling power and is not a security boundary.\n-"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" The CSS safety pipeline runs in a short-lived worker process, one worker per request, and the worke"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"r has exited before the stylesheet response is written. The host process therefore never loads the C"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"SS parser and never maps its native addon, which is what lets a package manager replace the parser p"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"ackage while the host runs (issue #98).\n- The pipeline belongs to one plugin mount: the mount create"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"s it, injects it into the routes and disposes it with the mount. A remount therefore gets its own pi"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"peline, and tearing down the old mount never disables the new one.\n- The pipeline holds at most eigh"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"t requests in total, the running one and the waiting ones alike. A request beyond that cap is refuse"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"d at once with `503 css-transform-overloaded`; a whitelist violation is still `422`, every other tra"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"nsform failure is still `500`.\n- No request can hang: every request carries a ten-second budget that"},{"id":"p16s14","text":" also covers a worker that answered but refuses to exit, and a worker that cannot be started fails t"},{"id":"p16s15","text":"he request immediately instead of waiting for the budget.\n- The custom-theme editor emits only fixed"},{"id":"p16s16","text":" declarations from `CUSTOM_THEME_ALLOWED_TOKENS`, each verified against the official token registry."},{"id":"p16s17","text":" User input is normalized color/contrast data and never becomes a selector, URL or free-form CSS pay"},{"id":"p16s18","text":" normalized color/contrast data and never becomes a selector, URL or free-form CSS payload.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Inline styles written by plugins at runtime can only be overridden by L3 `!important` patches.\n- P"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"lugins that do not output semantic attributes (and have no stable DOM anchors) receive L1 token cove"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"rage only.\n- Wallpaper pause-on-hidden, wallpaper blur, dimming and sound live in `dsh-plugin-wallpa"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"per-engine`'s own settings; the skin center has no wallpaper controls and its card only reports the "},{"id":"p18s5","text":"plugin's state.\n- While one stylesheet transform is running, the worker process holds the CSS parser"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"'s native addon, and a package install in that exact window still sees a mapped addon on Windows. Th"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"e window lasts one transform; the host process itself never holds it.\n- A burst of more than eight s"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"tylesheet requests is refused with `503` for the requests beyond the cap; the client has to retry th"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"esheet requests is refused with `503` for the requests beyond the cap; the client has to retry them."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
